      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793707400409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> What is in the Metadata Store ?\n    ° tracking records of :\n        - runs :\n            ° Runtime\n            ° Configuration parameters ( inputs / outputs )\n            ° ...\n        - workflow steps\n        - artifacts produced and consumed\n\n--> It is not meant to store data, it stores the metadata ( references\n    to data and relationships of data )\n\n--> It allows traceability of experiments :\n        ° Data Lineage :\n            - what are the inputs have produced this artifact\n            - find out how a given data was used \n            - what was used to create a given model\n\n\n--> Caching key calculation",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> What is in the Metadata Store ?\n    ° tracking records of :\n        - runs :\n            ° Runtime\n            ° Configuration parameters ( inputs / outputs )\n            ° ...\n        - workflow steps\n        - artifacts produced and consumed\n\n--> It is not meant to store data, it stores the metadata ( references\n    to data and relationships of data )\n\n--> It allows traceability of experiments :\n        ° Data Lineage :\n            - what are the inputs have produced this artifact\n            - find out how a given data was used \n            - what was used to create a given model\n\n\n--> Caching key calculation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1793611224546,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
