      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "° Multi-tenancy :\n    --> With this, that means if you have multiple organizations\n        working in the same OpenShift AI instance, they are completely\n        separate from each other and have their own servers that they'll\n        be working with independently from each other, and all that\n        metadata will be subject to that specific project, which will\n        then be only to that namespace that that project is then defined to",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "° Multi-tenancy :\n    --> With this, that means if you have multiple organizations\n        working in the same OpenShift AI instance, they are completely\n        separate from each other and have their own servers that they'll\n        be working with independently from each other, and all that\n        metadata will be subject to that specific project, which will\n        then be only to that namespace that that project is then defined to",
