      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> Instead of :\n        ° running each Notebook manually \n    or \n        ° performing all tasks in a single notebook, \n          which limits reusability of task specific code\n\n    ==> you could :\n         ° create \n        and \n        ° run a reusable Machine Learning Pipeline ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Instead of :\n        ° running each Notebook manually \n    or \n        ° performing all tasks in a single notebook, \n          which limits reusability of task specific code\n\n    ==> you could :\n         ° create \n        and \n        ° run a reusable Machine Learning Pipeline ",
